  "trace": [
    "Both owned and literal native INIT setup assign scalar1 when the corresponding global option is disabled.",
    "The ordinary fixture disables both global options; dormant_globals and setup_shuffle create mixed scalar/vector controls. These declarations are read statically, never evaluated here.",
