    "INIT reference handles channels through models.channel_sequence. Actual conditioned pre-network records fall through to event reference evaluate.",
    "The old event conditioned branch broadcasts rho_channel only; downstream GRN warm iterates both control owners and therefore cannot consume the legitimate scalar records.",
    "The reviewed adapter supplies a vector equation view and restores only original scalar owners not yet written. Production/native records and INIT channel equations remain unchanged."
